.next/
.env.local

# The repository root ignores `runs/` — that rule is for the scientific run
# output directories, which are hundreds of megabytes each. It is unanchored,
# so it also matched this app's `app/runs/` route folder and silently kept
# four page files out of a commit. Re-include the route directory here; the
# root rule still covers `runs/` at the repository root, which is what it was
# written for.
!app/runs/
